          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Sippin' on mint tea, take my shoes off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Then we take off, then I snooze off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Until I land where I'm foreign",
          "rhyme": "ajn",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Then I wake up, wipe the drool off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Got my passport in my weak hand",
          "rhyme": "#d",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I'ma cool off, get a sweet tan",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Loafers filled with beach sand",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Recline 'til it's time to peace sign",
          "rhyme": "ajn",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Fuck all the trains and the cars, get a passport",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "See the world, open your eyes 'til your back hurt",
          "rhyme": "uRt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Niggas get bread and won't leave, shit is backwards",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Start with your feet, then a car, then an airport",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Get out your bubble gum",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Blow up horizons, sun",
          "rhyme": "un",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Sled in the Alps or go tube in Missoula",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Or tour in Japan or go scuba in Cuba",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Or land in a borough, Jerrod got the brioche",
          "rhyme": "OS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Ciabatta in Como, it matches my peacoat",
          "rhyme": "Owt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Oversee the sea, all the things that you could see",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Like them languages I speak, out in Paris for a week",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Take my nephews, aunts and niece, they like \"Who?\" I'm like, \"Oui,\" ha",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
