        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Every car retarded, the garage look like a loony bin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "What coupe he in? Depends on the 'fit and the type of mood he in (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I been switchin' gears since Tracee Ellis Ross was UPN",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Clutch, then he stroke outta nowhere like a droopy grin (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Huh, took that Grammy home, couldn't lose again",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "The suit was so sharp that it could get Medusa coochie trimmed (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Hov talkin' 'bout a hundred million, nigga, loop me in",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Like who that young, rich, handsome nigga with the gooey skin? (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Mama named him Tyler and his brothers call him T",
          "rhyme": "t",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "And the bank, they call him when that wire clear like season three or somethin' (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Skateboard named him Bunnyhop, it's Baudelaire or Wolfie, though",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "The felines named him hour for how long he eat the— (Pussy) wait a minute (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "yt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Pink loafers scuff quickly, Fiat cost a buck sixty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I'll keep it a buck fifty, y'all can't really fuck with me (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Bitch, I got the fuzz and I'ma own it 'til they bury him",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Only twenty-nine, but I've been focused since thirty M (Ugh)",
          "rhyme": "m",
